{
 "duration": 60.760816,
 "frames": 1823,
 "phrases": [
  {
   "text": "Why is a marathon exactly twenty-six point two miles?",
   "start": 0.0,
   "end": 3.803
  },
  {
   "text": "Not twenty-five.",
   "start": 4.107,
   "end": 5.097
  },
  {
   "text": "Not twenty-six.",
   "start": 5.285,
   "end": 6.209
  },
  {
   "text": "Twenty-six point TWO.",
   "start": 6.631,
   "end": 8.342
  },
  {
   "text": "Most people think it's how far an ancient Greek messenger ran.",
   "start": 8.928,
   "end": 12.051
  },
  {
   "text": "Nope.",
   "start": 12.519,
   "end": 12.862
  },
  {
   "text": "Blame a royal family.",
   "start": 13.302,
   "end": 14.538
  },
  {
   "text": "London,",
   "start": 15.123,
   "end": 15.65
  },
  {
   "text": "nineteen-oh-eight.",
   "start": 15.848,
   "end": 16.754
  },
  {
   "text": "The Olympic marathon was planned at roughly twenty-six miles.",
   "start": 17.245,
   "end": 20.649
  },
  {
   "text": "But the organizers moved the start to Windsor Castle,",
   "start": 21.005,
   "end": 23.869
  },
  {
   "text": "right under the royal windows.",
   "start": 24.098,
   "end": 25.863
  },
  {
   "text": "The story goes the little princes and princesses wanted to watch from the nursery.",
   "start": 26.364,
   "end": 30.649
  },
  {
   "text": "And the finish?",
   "start": 31.165,
   "end": 31.814
  },
  {
   "text": "It had to land right in front of the royal box in the stadium.",
   "start": 32.203,
   "end": 35.285
  },
  {
   "text": "Best seat in the house.",
   "start": 35.735,
   "end": 36.767
  },
  {
   "text": "That added an extra three hundred and eighty-five yards.",
   "start": 37.207,
   "end": 40.451
  },
  {
   "text": "And those yards hurt.",
   "start": 40.952,
   "end": 41.732
  },
  {
   "text": "The leader,",
   "start": 41.732,
   "end": 42.318
  },
  {
   "text": "Dorando Pietri,",
   "start": 42.81,
   "end": 44.105
  },
  {
   "text": "collapsed again and again in the stadium,",
   "start": 44.105,
   "end": 47.212
  },
  {
   "text": "and officials literally helped him over the line.",
   "start": 47.525,
   "end": 50.202
  },
  {
   "text": "He got disqualified.",
   "start": 50.696,
   "end": 51.818
  },
  {
   "text": "But the weird distance stuck.",
   "start": 52.343,
   "end": 54.02
  },
  {
   "text": "In nineteen twenty-one,",
   "start": 54.523,
   "end": 55.623
  },
  {
   "text": "it became official.",
   "start": 55.623,
   "end": 56.722
  },
  {
   "text": "That's why a marathon is twenty-six point two miles.",
   "start": 57.239,
   "end": 60.761
  }
 ]
}